Subject: Seeing whether a word + pattern association is stronger in one corpus compared to another
Message-ID: <zZEW6Q2Qpic.iNtMnsH-lrYJ@corpling-with-r.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/corpling-with-r/c/zZEW6Q2Qpic/m/iNtMnsH-lrYJ>
